<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6569] DROP table is frozen in special case</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6569</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In attached project file:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run node with using of DropFrozenTableStartup class.&lt;br/&gt;
Execution is frozen in time of DROP table process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13107453">IGNITE-6569</key>
            <summary>DROP table is frozen in special case</summary>
